    cta: "Start a project",
    secondary: "See case studies",
    details: ["Strategy", "UX systems", "Launch support"]
  },
  {
    slug: "blueprint",
    label: "02 Blueprint Grid",
    eyebrow: "Structured, system-minded, and collaborative",
    title: "Great products start with shared direction.",
    body:
      "This concept leans into grids, planning, and cross-functional momentum. It is useful if you want the site to feel rigorous and product-led.",
    cta: "Book a design review",
    secondary: "Explore process",
    details: ["Research", "Roadmaps", "Design QA"]
  },
  {
    slug: "spotlight",
